WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.166
- Please answer. Please, please.	

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:04.125
- Ugh, Gisele, I gotta get this over with. It’s Jules. 

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:06.416
OH, HI, JULIAN!

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:08.583
- [Speaking in gruff voice] No, it’s Bruce Arians. See, I have the hat.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.125
Tom, we’re firing you.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.666
- Jules, I know it’s you. I have your number saved.

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:13.833
- [Speaking in own voice] You finally saved my number!

00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:16.416
[Back to gruff voice] It’s definitely Bucs coach 
Bruce Arians.

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.958
No risk it, no biscuit! I let my coaches go home
after work! Carson Palmer!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.583
- Jules, I can see all the framed photos of us behind you.

00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:27.333
- WE’RE STICKING WITH JAMEIS SINCE APPARENTLY YOU
 ALSO HAVE NO PROBLEM THROWING IT ALL AWAY.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.333
[Sobbing]

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.208
- Julian, you’re one of my favorite work friends. 

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.458
- You mean it, Tom?

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:34.750
- Sure.

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:37.375
- I wish I could come over and give you a big hug.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.166
- Yeah...oh but quarantine, right?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.333
- Right. Right. So why the f--k TAMPA BAY?

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:45.958
- I love the Tampa...culture.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:49.541
[Under his breath] And the Niners wouldn’t let me ruin Garoppolo’s life again.

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.416
- PLEASE, PLEASE STAY! I’LL STOP SELLING T-SHIRTS WITH YOUR FACE ON THEM!

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:55.166
- Oh uh, we’re breaking up, Jules! Sorry.

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:56.875
- NO, HERE, LET’S INCLUDE COACH.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.500
- Why am I suddenly SnapFacing?

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.666
I was watching teen trick-shot videos on TokTik.

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:04.958
It’s what counts as game film in our new reality.

00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:07.291
- COACH, YOU’RE ON WITH ME AND YOUR NO. 1 QUARTERBACK!

00:01:07.416 --> 00:01:09.041
- Oh, hi, Jarrett Stidham. 

